			"notes": "- Added Moonrise, Async and C2ME support.\n- Fixed leashed animals staying behind during mounted ender pearl teleports with TpWithMe.\n- Improved mounted chorus fruit interoperability with TpWithMe.\n- Fixed false unsafe-destination reports caused by checking chunk ticket readiness instead of readable terrain.\n- Added bounded retries while destination terrain loads, with eligibility, permission and protection checks before completion.\n- Fixed rapid back-and-forth teleports through destination retargeting and fresh timeouts after successful follow-up teleports.\n- Improved landing searches using full animal bounds, actual collision shapes, slabs and centered positions.\n- Fixed detached-lead accounting during cancellation, re-leashing, replacement requests and unresolved-mob timeouts.\n- Improved tick, disconnect and shutdown cleanup."
		},
